sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Elysia or Nuxt server
  participant Plugin as Telemetry plugin
  participant Logger
  participant OTel as OpenTelemetry SDK
  participant Collector
  App->>Plugin: Bootstrap service instrumentation
  Plugin->>Logger: Configure structured request logging
  Plugin->>OTel: Configure tracing, metrics, and fetch instrumentation
  App->>Plugin: Handle request
  Plugin->>Logger: Record safe request outcome
  Plugin->>OTel: Record span and runtime metrics
  OTel->>Collector: Export telemetry when configured
